Safeguards include review-first defaults, narrowly scoped automatic publication,
privacy exclusions, do-not-contact controls, strict automatic-output screening,
publication-attempt budgets, source revalidation, credential-safe errors,
ambiguous-publication lockout, and bounded default Bluesky Jetstream reception.
Automatic likes, favourites, boosts, and reposts are disabled.

